A||||8||87ECO5||87ECO5's 1987 economy coupe 5-speed||||6||
Z||000000||87ECO5||04-23-2000||09:57 PM||||I liked Batboy's idea of starting a thread that dealt with the work he was doing to his car so much, I decided to try the same thing for mine.<P>For those that care, read on.  For those that don't, please ignore.<P>Two weekends ago, I pulled the oil dipstick from my engine bay and cleaned it up a bit:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/eco5eo.jpg">  <P>The handle was sanded smooth, primed with engine enamel gray primer, colored with Testor's bright yellow model paint and covered with engine enamel clearcoat.  The 'ENGINE OIL' label was created using size 14 bold font Verdana and printed on standard clear mail label material with a bubble-jet printer.  The sticker was attached before the layers of clearcoat were applied.<P>Last weekend, I installed a recently-acquired short shifter from Fierodave and a nicer Delco head from BENGAL4 (thanks, guys!):<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/eco5ss.jpg">  <P>That shifter is one of the best things I've done to the car to date!  The throws are shorter and the feel is more crisp!<P>Finally, this weekend I installed a set of white face gauge decals:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/eco5gd.jpg">  <P>I think they look great and, though the photo doesn't do it justice, they look even better at night:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/eco5gn.jpg">  <P>The entire gauge lights up, making the gauges both easier to read and quite a sight to see.<P>More updates to come.  Thanks for the space.<p>[This message has been edited by 87ECO5 (edited 04-23-2000).]||||reg||6
Z||000001||2M4 Dale||04-23-2000||10:21 PM||||Looks Great Scott !!! I like the white face gauges. My first attempt at repairing my headliner failed today. I hope to have it up and in by Saturday. Not lookin' good though.||||reg||1
Z||000002||BOILERMAKER||04-23-2000||10:57 PM||||Now all you need is the V6 to go along with all of those way cool clean-ups you did.  Had to get the V6 jab in there somewhere.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Looks good, man, when you going to do mine?||||reg||1
