Z||000004||fiero56||04-23-2000||11:37 PM||||Those guages look AWSOME!!! Did you paint the needles, or were they already black?<P>Short Shifter looks good, although I personally think you need one of Rodney's shorter leather boots.<P>You didn't mention that the photo also shows your PAINTED ash tray doors.<P>Stereo looks good, did you get the tape deck working yet?<P>That is/will be the best looking '87 econo coupe around.||||reg||14
